New in 0.15:
• A harder field: fewer vegetables, sprouting slowly until you upgrade your soil
• The power bar fills with every hit
• Skills cost more, and each one says what its next level does
• The Pen pays less, and its runaways level up as you cut them
• Bling Barn looks are bought with cash
• New towns: Canada has 5, Japan 3, the others 4
• Rivals and crowns are gone: the third star is a first-try catch
• Bills in round amounts
